# Campaign trap 7: this campaign has TWICE shipped a bloated PR diff from
# tracked build artefacts. Nothing this directory produces that is a binary, a
# profiler report or a stderr spool may become tracked.
#
# The audit builds no binary of its own -- it reuses ../ab/gemvab_v, which
# ../ab/.gitignore already covers -- so what is listed here is what ncu and the
# sweeps drop beside the CSVs.
*.ncu-rep
*.nsys-rep
*.sqlite
*.qdrep
parity_err.txt
prize_err.txt
mechanism_err.txt
gemvab_*
